WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.620
Why did Paul want to preach the

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.720
gospel to people who already believed?

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.460
In Romans one,

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.720
he thanks God because their faith is

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.140
known throughout the world.

6
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.400
Yet he is eager to preach the

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.180
gospel to them.

8
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.340
They already belong to Christ,

9
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.300
and they still need to hear about

10
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:19.600
him:

11
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:20.760
who he is,

12
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.460
how he died and rose,

13
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.180
and what God has promised.

14
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.080
The same good news that awakens faith

15
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.780
continues to nourish it.

16
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.480
So when a familiar passage comes up,

17
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.460
slow down.

18
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.780
Ask what it teaches you about Christ.

19
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.520
Christian maturity includes hearing the gospel again,

20
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.440
understanding it more deeply,

21
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.320
and learning to live from it.
